WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.200
-We have such a great show
for you tonight.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.667
And you know what?

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:10.200
Before we go on, I'm a little
hungry. Do you guys mind?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.467
I'm just going to grab
something from

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:13.334
the "Tonight Show"
freezer really quick.

00:00:13.334 --> 00:00:14.834
It'll just take a second.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.133
So sorry about that.
Just got hungry.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.734
Thank you, thank you.

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:26.734
♪♪

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:30.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:32.567
No! No!

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:39.234
I'm stuck!
Someone help!

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:42.300
I'm stuck.
I'm stuck in the freezer.

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:46.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:51.234
-It's no use, Jimmy.
It's no use.

00:00:51.234 --> 00:00:53.868
-Mick Jagger?
What are you doing here?

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:57.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.234
-I ate a bunch of gazpacho,
and I needed

00:01:00.234 --> 00:01:02.968
to find a place to cool off.

00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:04.767
-But gazpacho is cold.

00:01:04.767 --> 00:01:08.200
-It was a hot gazpacho.
-This is awful.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.334
I knew that buying a soundproof
freezer was a mistake.

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:12.434
We're doomed.

00:01:12.434 --> 00:01:13.734
-Yes, we are doomed.

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:17.300
Well, since this
might be the end,

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.634
I have a few secrets
to share to get off my chest.

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:23.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:24.701
-Same.

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:28.067
When I text someone
"Sorry, I just saw your text,"

00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:31.167
I'm lying. I saw it right
when they sent it.

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:33.000
-I know.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.767
I have a secret
to share with you.

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:36.300
-Yeah?

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:39.367
-One time I did get
satisfaction.

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:42.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:45.567
-Way back. Way back in 1992.

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:48.100
-Really? From what?

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.567
-Popping bubble wrap.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:54.167
It's just so satisfying.

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:59.601
-I still cry
when I use no tear shampoo.

00:01:59.601 --> 00:02:03.968
-You know, I want to tell you
my real name.

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:05.934
It's not Mick.

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:07.534
It's Rick.

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:15.701
One time a barista got it wrong

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:18.934
and I was too polite
to correct her.

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:20.834
It just got stuck.
-It stuck, yeah

00:02:20.834 --> 00:02:23.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:33.033
No one really knows this,
but my laugh is fake.

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:38.033
Because if anyone heard my real
laugh, it would ruin my career.

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:41.701
-Can I hear your real laugh?

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:44.467
-I guess since
it's just us in here.

00:02:45.234 --> 00:02:49.534
[ Dolphin calling ]

00:02:49.534 --> 00:02:51.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:56.968
-I get it?
-Yeah.

00:02:56.968 --> 00:02:59.901
-Let me tell you something else.

00:02:59.901 --> 00:03:04.334
I never really liked
going to Studio 54.

00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:06.000
-Why not?
-Well, there's a much

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.901
better club next door.

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:09.234
-What was it called?

00:03:09.234 --> 00:03:10.434
-Uh...

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:12.100
Studio 55.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.067
-You know, being a late night
host actually

00:03:18.067 --> 00:03:19.934
wasn't my childhood dream.

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:23.100
Like a lot of comedians, I
always wanted to be a rock star.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.367
-That's weird.

00:03:24.367 --> 00:03:28.567
I always wanted
to be a comedian.

00:03:28.567 --> 00:03:29.767
-Like me?

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:31.067
-Yes.

00:03:31.067 --> 00:03:34.000
Like you, but funny.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:39.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:46.601
-Wow. Mick Jagger
called me funny.

00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:48.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.601 --> 00:03:50.701
-I never told anyone this
before,

00:03:50.701 --> 00:03:54.033
but I'm Banksy.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.734 --> 00:03:59.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:59.567 --> 00:04:02.667
-You know, sometimes
after a long run,

00:04:02.667 --> 00:04:04.701
I sprinkle pop rocks
in my undies.

00:04:04.701 --> 00:04:07.901
It's the only way I can feel.

00:04:07.901 --> 00:04:13.100
-I actually do a good
Jimmy Fallon impression.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:16.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:16.467 --> 00:04:17.968
-Can I hear it?

00:04:17.968 --> 00:04:19.601
-Sure.

00:04:19.601 --> 00:04:21.434
[ Dolphin calling ]

00:04:21.434 --> 00:04:23.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.501 --> 00:04:26.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:26.534 --> 00:04:27.701
-What?

00:04:27.701 --> 00:04:28.734
-What are you guys
doing in here?

00:04:28.734 --> 00:04:30.801
Oh, my God, it's Higgins!
We're saved!

00:04:30.801 --> 00:04:33.400
-Oh, my gosh.
Mick Jagger.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.067
Would you -- would you
sign my "Hackney Diamond" album?

00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:36.567
-Of course.
-Here you go.

00:04:36.567 --> 00:04:38.501
-Oh, my gosh.
This is great.

00:04:38.501 --> 00:04:41.634
-He's gonna sign it for you.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.634 --> 00:04:43.434
-Thank you.
-Yeah, cool.

00:04:43.434 --> 00:04:44.567
-Wait, it says Rick.

00:04:44.567 --> 00:04:46.434
-[ Blows ]

00:04:46.434 --> 00:04:49.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:57.701 --> 00:04:59.100
♪♪

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.267
-This has been...

00:05:02.267 --> 00:05:05.334
Stick around for more
"Tonight Show" after the break.

00:05:05.334 --> 00:05:10.567
♪♪

00:05:10.567 --> 00:05:12.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

